1
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Disney+ gets wild.

2
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:18,000
The Ice Age Adventures of Buck Wild is a animation,
comedy, family film directed by John C. Donkin.

3
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:24,000
The fearless one-eyed weasel Buck teams up with mischievous possum brothers Crash & Eddie
as they head off on a new adventure into Buck's home: The Dinosaur World.

4
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Buck (voice), played by Simon Pegg.

5
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Crash (voice), played by Vincent Tong.

6
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:42,000
Eddie (voice), played by Aaron Harris.

7
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:48,000
Orson (voice), played by Utkarsh Ambudkar.

8
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:54,000
Zee (or whatever her name is) (voice), played by Justina Machado.

9
00:36:54,000 --> 00:37:00,000
Manny (voice), played by Sean Kenin.

10
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:06,000
The Ice Age Adventures of Buck Wild is a 2022 animated
adventure comedy film directed by John C.

11
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:12,000
Donkin, in his feature directorial debut, with a screenplay by Jim Hecht, Ray
DeLaurentis, and William Schifrin based on a story written by Hecht.

12
00:49:12,000 --> 00:49:18,000
It is a spin-off film of the Ice Age franchise,
and the sixth overall installment.

13
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:24,000
The film stars the voices of Simon Pegg (the only previous cast member to return), Vincent Tong,
Aaron Harris, Utkarsh Ambudkar, and Justina Machado also starring in the film.

14
00:57:24,000 --> 00:57:30,000
It follows the two opossum brothers Crash and Eddie and their adventure to
becoming independent possums alongside the titular character Buck Wild.

15
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:36,000
Originally planned to be a television series, The Ice Age Adventures of
Buck Wild was redeveloped into a feature-length film.

16
01:05:36,000 --> 01:05:42,000
Produced by 20th Century Animation and released under the Walt Disney Pictures
banner, it was released on January 28, 2022 as a Disney+ original film.

17
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:48,000
The film received generally negative reviews from critics.

18
01:13:48,000 --> 01:13:54,000
The film explores themes of ice age, snow, spin off, polar adventure.

19
01:17:54,000 --> 01:18:00,000
The tone is lighthearted.
